msgid ""
"Effective from the next login. Programs receive language and formats when they start; programs that are already running keep theirs. Querencia’s default: texts {language}, formats {formats} (LANGUAGE={language_variable}, LANG={lang_variable})."
msgstr ""
"Wirksam ab der nächsten Anmeldung. Programme bekommen Sprache und Formate beim Start mit; bereits laufende behalten ihre. Vorgabe von Querencia: Texte {language}, Formate {formats} (LANGUAGE={language_variable}, LANG={lang_variable})."

